<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n34205" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμπαίζω</span></b> , fut.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ξομαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Hb.</u>
					1.10
				</span></i>
			: pf.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμπέπαιχα</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				<u>Nu.</u>
				22.29
			</span></i>:— <i>mock at, mock</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					4.134
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PCair.Preis.</u>
					3.10
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iv A.D.)</span>: abs., <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ant.</u>
				799
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψυχὴ ὑπό . . σωμάτων καὶ πραγμάτων
					ἐμπαιζομένη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					1.568
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Trag.</u>
				333
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> euphem. in
			mal. part., <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Jd.</u>
				19.25
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, <i>to be deluded,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ev.Matt.
				2.16
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				10.56.2
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Pall.
			</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
				Vett.Val.
				16.14
			</span></i>; <i>to be defrauded</i>, of the revenues, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Cod.Just.</u>
				1.34.2
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>sport in</i> or <i>on</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὡς νεβρὸς χλοεραῖς ἐ. λείμακος
					ἡδοναῖς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Ba.</u>
					866
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῖς χοροῖσιν ἐ</span>.
				<i>to sport in</i> the dance, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Th.</u>
				975
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῷ γυμνασίῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Lex.</u>
					5
				</span></i>
			.</div>
